1
00:06:39,000 --> 00:06:45,000
Gabriel's Rapture: Part III is a romance film directed by Tosca Musk.

2
00:13:18,000 --> 00:13:24,000
In the sixth installment of the Gabriel's Inferno series, Julia deals with the aftermath
of Gabriel's departure, while Gabriel goes on a journey of self-discovery.

3
00:19:57,000 --> 00:20:03,000
Will they reunite and be able to repair what is broken?

4
00:26:36,000 --> 00:26:42,000
Julia Mitchell, played by Melanie Zanetti.

5
00:33:15,000 --> 00:33:21,000
Gabriel Emerson, played by Giulio Berruti.

6
00:39:54,000 --> 00:40:00,000
Passionflix is an entertainment streaming platform and production company.

7
00:46:33,000 --> 00:46:39,000
Founded in 2017 by director and producer Tosca Musk, screenwriter Joany Kane, and producer Jina Panebianco, it focuses on
releasing original film adaptations of the best-selling romantic novels, while also streaming classic romantic movies.

8
00:53:12,000 --> 00:53:18,000
Passionflix also makes erotic thrillers.

9
00:59:51,000 --> 00:59:57,000
The Hollywood Reporter describes Passionflix productions in general as "saucier than Hallmark but much tamer
than porn, tamer even than some R-rated movies." No frontal nudity below the waist is shown.

10
01:06:30,000 --> 01:06:36,000
As co-founder and CEO Tosca Musk explains, "Passionflix is
there to remove shame from sexuality...

11
01:13:09,000 --> 01:13:15,000
We are there to encourage connection, communication and compromise in relationships and we’re there to validate emotions." Movies and television series on this
platform are categorized according to a "barometer of naughtiness" ranging from "Oh so vanilla" (for romantic comedies) to "NSFW" (not safe for work).

12
01:19:48,000 --> 01:19:54,000
The New York Times characterizes these as having "simple"
plots and "sometimes unrefined" acting.

13
01:26:27,000 --> 01:26:33,000
Wired opines that the "acting is good, the actors are hot, and the plots deliver; don’t ask about the
cinematography." Each film has a budget of no more than $10 million and is typically shot within a fortnight.

14
01:33:06,000 --> 01:33:12,000
"Founding members" or "Signature members"—fans who paid a premium subscription—have the
right to be on set during filming and offer their views on what should be done.

15
01:39:45,000 --> 01:39:51,000
Some might even appear as extras.

16
01:46:24,000 --> 01:46:30,000
Musk likens this form of fan service to having her own "focus group" on set.

17
01:53:03,000 --> 01:53:09,000
Although the platform is technically available worldwide, licensed
contents can only be watched in the United States.

18
01:59:42,000 --> 01:59:48,000
Subtitles are available in nine languages.

19
02:06:21,000 --> 02:06:27,000
The tone is emotional.
